JOB-1768302418046-7lzguuz4z	743ef9d1-841a-11ed-aa7c-7003bca91a86	COMP-1768302392842-jfk6udofr	601.005.01	ME connecting rods, crosshead, guides No.01	MKR-IN-00076	Main Engine – Connecting Rods, Crosshead & Guide Assemblies Inspection - 1M	2nd Engineer	Inspection	Calendar	\N	1	Months	\N	\N	\N	\N	13-Dec-2025	13-Jan-2026	\N	\N	Low	No	SAFETY PROCEDURE (COMPANY)\r\n===========================\r\nEnsure compliance with safety procedures according to the company policy and requirements.\r\n\r\nDESCRIPTION\r\n===========\r\n1. Connecting Rods\r\n\r\nInspect connecting rods externally for cracks, deformation, or abnormal discoloration.\r\n\r\nCheck for oil leakage from big-end bearings and oil supply pipes.\r\n\r\nVerify securing arrangements (nuts, locking devices) are intact.\r\n\r\n2. Crosshead Assembly\r\n\r\nInspect crosshead pin area for abnormal noise, vibration, or overheating.\r\n\r\nCheck crosshead bearing lubrication and oil flow.\r\n\r\nMonitor bearing temperatures and compare with previous records.\r\n\r\n3. Guide Shoes & Guide Rails\r\n\r\nInspect guide shoes for uneven wear, scoring, or overheating marks.\r\n\r\nCheck guide rail surfaces for scratches, wear, or abnormal polishing.\r\n\r\nVerify guide shoe clearance (as per maker’s limits where measurable).\r\n\r\n4. Lubrication System\r\n\r\nConfirm correct oil supply to crosshead and guide shoe lubrication points.\r\n\r\nCheck oil pressure and temperature for crosshead lube system.\r\n\r\nInspect lube oil filters related to crosshead system.\r\n\r\n5. Performance & Trend Monitoring\r\n\r\nReview vibration, noise, and temperature trends.\r\n\r\nCompare cylinder-wise data for abnormal deviation.\r\n\r\nReview lube oil analysis results (if applicable).	SAFETY PROCEDURE (COMPANY)\r\n===========================\r\nEnsure compliance with safety procedures according to the company policy and requirements.\r\n\r\nDESCRIPTION\r\n===========\r\n1. Connecting Rods\r\n\r\nInspect connecting rods externally for cracks, def