JOB-1768302822312-7zt3cq69k	743feb08-841a-11ed-aa7c-7003bca91a86	COMP-1768302796860-yhsu446nn	702.005.01	FO separators No.01	MKR-OV-00008	Purifier, Overhaul - 6M	3rd Engineer	Overhaul	Calendar	\N	6	Months	\N	\N	\N	\N	14-Jul-2025	14-Jan-2026	\N	\N	Medium	No	SAFETY PROCEDURE (COMPANY)\r\n===========================\r\nEnsure compliance with safety procedures according to the company policy and requirements.\r\n\r\nJOB REFERENCE DETAILS\r\n===================\r\nManual Name: 8M-3 INSTRUCTION MANAUL FOR PURIFIER;5303.pdf\r\nPdf Page No: 60, 78-84\r\nChapter: 3. Maintenance Inspection Procedures\r\n5. Periodic Inspection Chart\r\nSection: 3.4 Expendable parts replacement intervals\r\n5. Periodic inspection chart\r\n\r\nDESCRIPTION\r\n===========\r\nA. Parts Replacement:\r\n1. Bowl replacement parts:\r\n - Main seal ring.\r\n - O ring and the like.\r\n - Valve sheet.\r\n\r\nB. Check the below parts for good condition.\r\n1. Inside of frame:\r\n - Check deposited sludge contamination.\r\n2. Operating water drain outlet:\r\n - Check deposited sludge contamination.\r\n3. Impeller:\r\n - Check for contamination, contact damage, deformation, corrosion.\r\n4. Upper hood & lower hood o ring:\r\n - Check for damage, wear, hardened.\r\n5. Whole of inside of bowl:\r\n - Deposited sludge, corrosion.\r\n6. Disc:\r\n - Check deposited sludge, corrosion, cracks, deformation.\r\n - Check aperture piece loss.\r\n - No. of discs height of discs.\r\n7. Bowl body:\r\n - Check sludge outlet port corrosion, wear.\r\n - Check O -ring groove damage.\r\n - Check operating water passage clogging.\r\n - Check bowl bush fitting portion damage, scoring, fit, wear.\r\n - Check main cylinder sliding portion damage.\r\n - Check knock pin deformation.\r\n8. Bowl nut:\r\n - Check threaded portion damage, coring.\r\n - Check bowl fitting portion damage.\r\n - Check groove contamination, clogging.\r\n9. Bowl hood:\r\n - Check bowl nut fitting portion.\r\n - Check bowl body fitting portion damage.\r\n - Check threaded portion scoring.\r\n - Check light liquid chamber fitting portion damage.\r\n - Check O -ring groove damage, deformation.\r\n - Check knock pin groove damage, deformation.\r\n10. Main seal ring:\r\n - Inspect seal surface damage, deterioration.\r\n - Inspect seal surface dimension.\r\n11. Deformation inspection:\r\n - Distributor keyway deformation.\r\n - Threaded portion damage.\r\n - Knock pin deformation.\r\n12. Inspect various types of O -rings of bowl for deterioration, cracks, wear.\r\n13. Main cylinder:\r\n - Check main seal ring seal surface damage, wear, corrosion.\r\n - Check bowl body sliding portion damage, wear, peeled plating.\r\n - Check O -ring groove contamination.\r\n14. Pilot valve:\r\n - Check damage for bowl body sliding portion.\r\n - Check valve sheet seat surface damage, deformation, foreign substances caught.\r\n15. Light liquid chamber:\r\n - Check contamination, worn threaded portion, corrosion.\r\n16. Heavy liquid chamber:\r\n - Check contamination, corrosion, cracks.\r\n17. Gravity disc:\r\n - Check contamination, corrosion, cracks.\r\n18. Bowl bush:\r\n - Check contact with bowl.\r\n19. Drain nozzle check clogging.\r\n20 . Vertical shaft:\r\n - Check upper portion (above bearing (1)) for corrosion, wear.\r\n - Threaded portion damage.\r\n - Pinion tooth surface wear.\r\n21. Water supplying system:\r\n - Check operating water nozzle and chamber for contamination, clogged drilled hole, damage.\r\n - Check O -ring for damage, deterioration, deformation.\r\n22. Solenoid valve:\r\n - Check leakage of seal part .\r\n23. Reducing valve:\r\n - Check leakage of seal part .\r\n - Check pressure gauge pressure indication\r\n24. Check multi monitor alarm functions .	SAFETY PROCEDURE (COMPANY)\r\n===========================\r\nEnsure compliance with safety procedures according to the company policy and requirements.\r\n\r\nJOB REFERENCE DETAILS\r\n===================\r\nManual Name: 8M-3 INSTRUCTION MANAUL FOR PURIFIER;5303.pdf\r\nPdf Pa