.\r\n12. Check steel ball for deformation, grooved damage .\r\n13. Vertical shaft:\r\n - Check whole broken, cracks dimension spring height.\r\n - Check spring seat wear.\r\n - Check bearing block (2) assembled dimension.\r\n - Check bearing for noise, sticking, corrosion.\r\n14. Check horizontal shaft:\r\n - Check wear at threaded portion and bearing fitting portion .\r\n - Check joint safety groove .\r\n - Check spiral gear and wear\r\n - Check wear of collar , friction clutch and friction pulley .\r\n - Check oil leakage .\r\n - Check bearing housing and bearing noise . \r\n15. Solenoid valve:\r\n - Check diaphragm deterioration, deformation, broken, contamination.\r\n - Inside of valve deposited scale, damage.\r\n16. Reducing valve:\r\n - Check diaphragm deterioration, deformation, broken, contamination.\r\n - Inside of valve sheet surface deposited scale, damage.	SAFETY PROCEDURE (COMPANY)\r\n===========================\r\nEnsure compliance with safety procedures according to the company policy and requirements.\r\n\r\nJOB REFERENCE DETAILS\r\n===================\r\nManual Name: 8M-3 INSTRUCTION MANAUL FOR PURIFIER;5303.pdf\r\nPdf Page No: 60-61, 78,81,82,83\r\nChapter: 3. Maintenance Inspection Procedures\r\nSection: 3.4 Expendable parts replacement intervals\r\n5. Periodic inspection chart\r\n\r\nDESCRIPTION\r\n===========\r\nA. Replace the following parts\r\n1. Frame, cover:\r\n - O ring\r\n - Gasket (for piping).\r\n2. Vertical shaft, water supplying device:\r\n - O ring\r\n - Upper spring.\r\n - Gasket.\r\n3. Horizontal shaft:\r\n - Oil seal.\r\n - Friction block.\r\n\r\nB. Checks to be carried on following parts:\r\n1. Check rubber plate sagging.\r\n2. Check brake lining wear.\r\n3. Check sludge pipe for deteriorated rubber.\r\n4. Vertical shaft:\r\n - Check bowl bushing fitting portion for damage, corrosion, fit.\r\n - Check bearing fitting portion wear.\r\n - Check whole of shaft centre runout.\r\n - Shaft height assembled dimension.\r\n5. Upper spring: