JOB-1768381233874-efebwqtpw	744535d0-841a-11ed-aa7c-7003bca91a86	COMP-1768381196850-53oroaxgr	651.002.01	AE 1 AE cylinder covers w/valves No.01	MKR-IN-00080	AE Cylinder Covers with Valves Inspection - 1M	3rd Engineer	Inspection	Calendar	\N	1	Months	\N	\N	\N	\N	14-Dec-2025	14-Jan-2026	\N	\N	Low	No	SAFETY PROCEDURE (COMPANY)\r\n===========================\r\nEnsure compliance with safety procedures according to the company policy and requirements.\r\n\r\nDESCRIPTION\r\n===========\r\n1. Cylinder Cover Condition\r\n\r\nInspect cylinder covers externally for cracks, corrosion, or hot spots.\r\n\r\nCheck for leakage of combustion gas, cooling water, or lube oil.\r\n\r\nVerify tightness condition of cover securing nuts (visual check).\r\n\r\n2. Cooling Water Passages\r\n\r\nCheck cooling water inlet and outlet connections for leakage.\r\n\r\nMonitor jacket water temperature and pressure for each cylinder.\r\n\r\nLook for abnormal temperature deviation between cylinders.\r\n\r\n3. Valves (Inlet / Exhaust / Indicator / Starting if fitted)\r\n\r\nInspect exhaust valve area for gas leakage or overheating.\r\n\r\nCheck inlet valve area for abnormal noise or leakage.\r\n\r\nInspect indicator and starting valves for tightness and free operation.\r\n\r\nEnsure valve caps and safety devices are properly fitted.	SAFETY PROCEDURE (COMPANY)\r\n===========================\r\nEnsure compliance with safety procedures according to the company policy and requirements.\r\n\r\nDESCRIPTION\r\n===========\r\n1. Cylinder Cover Condition\r\n\r\nInspect cylinder covers externally for cracks, corrosion, or hot spots.\r\n\r\nCheck for leakage of combustion gas, cooling water, or lube oil.\r\n\r\nVerify tightness condition of cover securing nuts (visual check).\r\n\r\n2. Cooling Water Passages\r\n\r\nCheck cooling water inlet and outlet connections for leakage.\r\n\r\nMonitor jacket water temperature and pressure for each cylinder.\r\n\r\nLook for abnormal temperature deviation between cylinders.\r