h the set pressure of the leakage.\r\n4. Check for any increase in vibration.\r\n5. Check for operational noise in gear pump and bearing etc. \r\n6. Check the rated current on daily basis.\r\n7. Check the gear pump oil quantity. \r\n8. Check the safety joint of gears for any deformation.\r\n9. Check for oil leakage in pipe joints.\r\n10. Check & adjust pressure LED (yellow) lit or flashing for Leakage Monitor.\r\n11. Check indicate revolution LED (green) is flashing for Discharge Monitor.	Chief Engineer	Engine	[]	[]	{"ppeRequirements":[],"permitRequirements":[],"otherRequirements":[]}	vessel	702.005.AA	\N	\N	Yes	t	\N	\N	2026-01-14 09:00:34.758423	\N	2026-01-14 09:06:56.731
